We connected approaching the station, onboarding, reading support, and departure into one coherent service."}]]}],["$","article","04",{"className":"mvp-card","tabIndex":0,"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mvp-number","children":["Stage ","04"]}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"System feasibility"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mvp-keywords","children":"Hardware · Interactions"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mvp-detail","children":"A system diagram and hardware specification made the concept concrete enough to evaluate beyond the interface."}]]}],["$","article","05",{"className":"mvp-card","tabIndex":0,"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mvp-number","children":["Stage ","05"]}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"Responsible design"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mvp-keywords","children":"Privacy · Stigma · Autonomy"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mvp-detail","children":"We pressure-tested every feature against accessibility, dignity, data minimization, and reader control."}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"pagelens-process-figures","children":[["$","figure",null,{"children":[["$","img",null,{"src":"/projects/pagelens/research/pagelens-experience-flow.png","alt":"PageLens four-stage user flow from approaching the station to leaving"}],["$","figcaption",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"Experience model"}],["$","strong",null,{"children":"A coherent journey before individual screens."}]]}]]}],["$","figure",null,{"children":[["$","img",null,{"src":"/projects/pagelens/research/pagelens-system-architecture.png","alt":"PageLens system diagram connecting camera, tablet, AI, hardware, and book"}],["$","figcaption",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"Technical feasibility"}],["$","strong",null,{"children":"Five layers working as one reading station."}]]}]]}],["$","figure",null,{"className":"pagelens-system-figure","children":[["$","img",null,{"src":"/projects/pagelens/design/pagelens-design-system.png","alt":"PageLens accessibility-focused color 